L2:(5) Consider the recommendations of advisory boards or panels, when applicable; and
L2:(6) Select the offeror or offerors whose proposal is the best value to the Government (10 U.S.C. 3303(c) and 41 U.S.C. 3703(c)). The SSA may reject all proposals received in response to a RFP, if doing so is in the best interest of the Government.
