L2:(4) Award the contract(s).
L1:(d) Limitations. Government personnel involved in the acquisition must not engage in conduct that—
L2:(1) Favors one offeror over another;
L2:(2) Reveals an offeror's technical solution, including—
L3:(i) Unique technology;
L3:(ii) Innovative and unique uses of commercial products or commercial services; or
L3:(iii) Any information that would compromise an offeror's intellectual property to another offeror;
L2:(3) Reveals an offeror's price without that offeror's permission.
