L1:(b) Method . Debriefings may be done by any method acceptable to the contracting officer.
L1:(c) Content .
L2:(1) At a minimum, the debriefing information must include—
L3:(i) The Government's evaluation of the significant weaknesses or deficiencies in the offeror's proposal, if applicable;
