L2:(1) Be innovative and unique;
L2:(2) Be independently originated and developed by the offeror;
L2:(3) Be prepared without Government supervision, endorsement, direction, or direct Government involvement;
L2:(4) Include sufficient detail to permit a determination that Government support could be worthwhile and the proposed work could benefit the agency's research and development or other mission responsibilities;
