L2:(2) Include delivery terms and conditions or specify how they will be determined;
L2:(3) List one or more Government activities authorized to issue orders under the agreement;
L2:(4) Specify the point at which each order becomes a binding contract (e.g., issuance of the order, acceptance of the order in a specified manner, or failure to reject the order within a specified number of days);
