L2:(6) For Department of Defense purchases, the contract will promote national security of the United States; and
L2:(7) For Department of Defense contracts valued at $500,000,000 or more, the Secretary certifies that the conditions in 10 U.S.C. 3501 (i)(3) subparagraphs (C) through (F) will be met.

