L1:(f) The agency does not expect to make more than one payment to the same recipient within a one-year period;
L1:(g) An agency's need for supplies and services is of such unusual and compelling urgency that the Government would be seriously injured unless payment is made by a method other than EFT;
L1:(h) There is only one source for supplies and services and the Government would be seriously injured unless payment is made by a method other than EFT; or
L1:(i) Otherwise authorized by Department of the Treasury Regulations at 31 CFR part 208.

